{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A set of weapon spray paints in metallic finishes and solid-color designs, delivering a premium aesthetic while adding a distinctive personal mark to your firearms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This expansion includes 7 weapon customization spray paints and item purchase authorizations from merchant(s).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pack Includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spray Paints:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golden Gleam (1 pcs.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mithril (1 pcs.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zeal (1 pcs.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turquoise (1 pcs.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pristine White (1 pcs.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Candy Blue (1 pcs.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Candy Pink (1 pcs.)</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merchant Store(s)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocks 'Golden Gleam' spray paint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocks 'Mithril' spray paint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocks 'Zeal' spray paint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocks 'Turquoise' spray paint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocks 'Pristine White' spray paint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocks 'Candy Blue' spray paint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocks 'Candy Pink' spray paint</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spray paints can be applied to weapons at the Spray Painting Booth in the Hideout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items included in this DLC will be sent via in-game mails. Please check your mailbox after purchase to claim your items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DLC contents will be reissued after each data reset, its actual content is subject to change in future updates.</p>","background":"https://store.akama